{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a First Person, Colony-Survival Game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your territory, build thriving villages, and strengthen your forces as rival factions vie for control of the land. Walk amongst your people as their leader, placing every building by hand, defending against raids, and personally leading the charge into enemy lands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your kingdom tile by tile with villages, resource centres, crafting hubs or strategic defences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your forces into grand battles, invade rival territories and defend your borders against incoming raiders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, forge stronger weapons and armour for your army, or enhance your own abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your borders grow so too does your kingdom\u2019s wealth and total production.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedurally generated and persistent world on a massive scale, every single tile can be explored, conquered and altered!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your settlers live along side you, assign them roles to best serve you and the realm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ideal kingdom with structures, decorations, landscaping and even custom buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A varied combat system with weapons that each affect how they interact in the world and against hostiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a pristine Scandinavian world with a unique 3D pixel art style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832210?t=1764474298","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a