s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, forge stronger weapons and armour for your army, or enhance your own abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your borders grow so too does your kingdom\u2019s wealth and total production.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedurally generated and persistent world on a massive scale, every single tile can be explored, conquered and altered!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your settlers live along side you, assign them roles to best serve you and the realm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ideal kingdom with structures, decorations, landscaping and even custom buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A varied combat system with weapons that each affect how they interact in the world and against hostiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a pristine Scandinavian world with a unique 3D pixel art style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Tom Brook"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/7322a91b9a58d186676e85ab161c7654b6e23cca/header.jpg?t=1764474298","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3832210/380882767/1c4f31199144c749048f34d4e3d8ecbe817426ce/1756483365/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756918844","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3832210/380882767/1c4f3119914